+## [0.8.0] — Unreleased
+
+### Added
+- `configlayer.typed` — typed, validating access to merged configuration:
+  `TypedView` with `get_str`/`get_int`/`get_float`/`get_bool`/`get_list`,
+  duration getters ("1h30m" → seconds) and byte-size getters ("512MB",
+  "4KiB" → bytes, computed exactly), dotted-key lookups, `scope()` sub-views
+  that keep full-path error messages, and `ValidationError` on every
+  non-conforming value.  The underlying `parse_bool`/`parse_duration`/
+  `parse_size`/`parse_items` grammars are exported for direct use.
+- `TypedView` re-exported from the top-level package.
+
